                    {
                        "sense_id": "fb4b371d-dbfd-3b4c-887d-33aca4332739",
                        "entry_id": "f511f982-2759-3cbf-b21f-9d7d30d694db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "przenoszenie się z miejsca na miejsce za pomocą pojazdów"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac5b3601-5731-4822-a91b-d1eac583c567",
                                "sense_id": "fb4b371d-dbfd-3b4c-887d-33aca4332739",
                                "text": "Widzieliśmy film o środkach lokomocji w naszym mieście."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c42a4d0f-1929-3578-95d7-0d0a4bf19bff",
                        "entry_id": "f511f982-2759-3cbf-b21f-9d7d30d694db",
                        "glosses": [
                            "zdolność poruszania się"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23377478-fe82-4371-9a7f-0d834df87ad0",
                                "sense_id": "c42a4d0f-1929-3578-95d7-0d0a4bf19bff",
                                "text": "Sprawna lokomocja organizmów wymaga obecności odpowiedniego systemu napędowego."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5c620d52-88ae-4a1f-ae11-5ca3041983e9",
                        "source_entry_id": "f511f982-2759-3cbf-b21f-9d7d30d694db",
                        "source_sense_id": "c42a4d0f-1929-3578-95d7-0d0a4bf19bff",
                        "target_lang_word": "locomotion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "locomotion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "895ccb51-0a0f-3d06-acc6-fdec8dac3748",
                                        "entry_id": "f79e8cb5-9545-3d86-8af0-447ce07796ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ability to move from place to place, or the act of doing so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab65b8a9-6a4a-3fdd-8d4e-fd7b2381f23c",
                                        "entry_id": "f79e8cb5-9545-3d86-8af0-447ce07796ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Self-powered motion by which a whole organism changes its location through walking, running, jumping, crawling, swimming, brachiating or flying."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10f1fe82-3182-43e5-b278-154f1a593d96",
                                                "sense_id": "ab65b8a9-6a4a-3fdd-8d4e-fd7b2381f23c",
                                                "text": "So it is that one of the characteristics that the sperm whale shares with all cetaceans is that it swims by flexing its tail flukes dorso-ventrally, a less efficient way of swimming than that of its distant piscine ancestors, but a mode of locomotion that derives directly from the galloping of its more recent terrestrial ones."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89069d84-485a-4638-8aef-87411bc791fd",
                                                "sense_id": "ab65b8a9-6a4a-3fdd-8d4e-fd7b2381f23c",
                                                "text": "The assessment also looks at reflexes, stationary (body control), locomotion (movement), grasping and visual-motor integration (eyes and hands coordinated)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5fae35b6-6bb8-396a-b64f-be09464aa60d",
                                        "entry_id": "f79e8cb5-9545-3d86-8af0-447ce07796ab",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A dance, originally popular in the 1960s, in which the arms are used to mimic the motion of the connecting rods of a steam locomotive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19ff83a0-3a68-4648-a623-7462d62c60d4",
                                                "sense_id": "5fae35b6-6bb8-396a-b64f-be09464aa60d",
                                                "text": "Mr. Motian's own tunes, folk-simple locomotions of straight melody, fast or slow, with acres of room for interpretation, have accounted for some of the mistier sets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a4d4140-325c-44e4-a5fb-5303a6ca36b6",
                        "source_entry_id": "f511f982-2759-3cbf-b21f-9d7d30d694db",
                        "source_sense_id": "fb4b371d-dbfd-3b4c-887d-33aca4332739",
                        "target_lang_word": "locomotion",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "locomotion",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3ad8fc5-c421-3fb4-94ce-245413bf5721",
                                        "entry_id": "872069d5-c726-3e16-83b9-2e28fa1638bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Changement de lieu en vertu de la faculté locomotrice."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f824336f-0bd3-4afb-b167-8897acc8bbbf",
                                                "sense_id": "e3ad8fc5-c421-3fb4-94ce-245413bf5721",
                                                "text": "C'est à l'occasion du Saint-Léger gagné par Elis que l'on usa pour la première fois d'un van comme mode de locomotion pour les chevaux. Ce fut l'occasion d'un coup monstre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54c63da7-bd89-4fef-a180-728ff8fae7cd",
                                                "sense_id": "e3ad8fc5-c421-3fb4-94ce-245413bf5721",
                                                "text": "La préoccupation qui, chez les hommes, semble dominer toutes les autres, c’est celle de la vitesse obtenue soit par leurs propres moyens, soit par des instruments, et des appareils de locomotion, au perfectionnement desquels ils appliquent le meilleur de leur ingéniosité et de leurs facultés inventives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcfb33ee-d57b-491f-b06e-14ef0f020da4",
                                                "sense_id": "e3ad8fc5-c421-3fb4-94ce-245413bf5721",
                                                "text": "Dieu seul sait si, comme le savant Cosinus, il n’inventa pas, au cours de sa retraite haut-patatoise, quelque moyen de locomotion de même farine que l’anémélectroreculpédalicoupeventombrosoparacloucycle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
